# MLPx2 EOS backend (SCOPING SKELETON — new files only).
#
# This mirrors RealFluidCO2/Make.package.  The MLPx2/EOS.H stub currently
# forwards every namespace EOS entry point to the device-inline PR
# machinery in hem_pr_state.H (so a build is bit-identical to
# RealFluidCO2), with TODO(MLPx2) markers where MLP inference will replace
# the PR solve.
#
# When the device-inline MLP inference is added, list its headers here,
# e.g.:
#     CEXE_headers += mlpx2_inference.H
#     CEXE_headers += mlpx2_weights.H   (or a device weight-buffer loader)
#
# NOTE: hem_pr_state.H and hem_saturation_amrex.H currently live in
# ../RealFluidCO2/.  They must be made visible to this dir before MLPx2
# can build standalone — either copy them in (and list them below) or add
# ../RealFluidCO2 to the include path in the exec build.  See README.md.

CEXE_headers += EOS.H
